//   expected_live_revision (the Project's Live pointer). The BFF fills in no ID and no fence.
// - Integer types follow the Go domain type: uint64 for revisions, generations and fences; int64
//   for Agent sequences, todo list revisions, repository_id and after_event_id; int32
